package migration
    provides [m02_slice, claim_m02_identity_problems, validate_m02_claim, campaign_m02_manifest]
    uses [coverage, reducer, registry, spec, text]

/// Z01 migration-coverage reconciliation, slice m02 (CORE-005..CORE-041).
/// Per-row facet, variant, environment and delegated-declaration mappings
/// for 4 Callables, generics and template checking rows. Multi-case rows: one row_map per (row, case) pair; claims resolve through row_case_index; the shared credit, campaign
/// and obligation machinery is reused unchanged from the pilot. Source
/// hashes are the reviewed sha256 bindings of the bound files; a bound-file
/// edit invalidates its binding until re-reviewed. Delegates are checked
/// both directions. Provisional until P23: no execution credit is claimed.

// (Row data lines are long by construction: each row_map carries the full
// reviewed binding for CORE-005..CORE-041. Generated from the row evidence
// case_check_ids plus sha256 of the bound files.)
fn row_map[] m02_slice
    emits {}
    given
        str scope
    asserts
